{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello World!! Welcom to my first making game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A long time ago, from the 70's to early 80's, I had nostalgic memories of loving games that you could play by inserting a coin, so I created a game that feels like that! It's a simple and easy game, so please give it a try!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2015, L.Planning suddenly reincarnates into another world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaited them was an unimaginable drop in sales...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Takeru, a sales employee, is now taking on the burden of the suffering and expectations of executives! !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you have to do is become Takeru-kun and send the quotation request (green box) received from your business partner to the CEO, and the invoice request (red box) to the CFO.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Wave the magic wand with the A button and send the box to the CEO.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Swing the magic ax with the B button and send the box to the CFO.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926300/extras/1705aacbab1a7777e1717f148185230c.avif?t=1768314443\" width=64 height=64 /></span>CEO: He loves approving quotes!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926300/extras/c9134372cb5915360a43933ee2c10116.avif?t=1768314443\" width=64 height=64 /></span>CFO: He loves counting the money in our bank account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926300/extras/f2600a06a2971c80ee664aa1dda1039f.avif?t=1768314443\" width=64 height=64 /></span>Greenbox: Request for quotation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926300/extras/969ad1e96a474ed11d4112fe1c4805b7.avif?t=1768314443\" width=64 height=64 /></span>Redbox: Billing request</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's really simple... but please don't send the wrong box, they will be damaged if they see documents they don't understand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and it's dangerous to touch the box directly; it's extremely violent, so you'll have to use magic to deal with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1P or 2P Story mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main mode of this work.<br>A single-player or 2P co-op mode that follows Takeru's story at L.Planning. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1P or 2P High Score mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A mode where two people work together, either single or by screen sharing, to aim for a high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4P Battle mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four employees might send documents all over the place using screen sharing, and sometimes they might make a mistake and hit someone on their team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last employee who survives is the winner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please have fun with Remote Play Together!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2926300?t=1768314443","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926300/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768314443","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926300/a3b2a0607a4a5f6cbb7ed317050556949df9aa2a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768314443","capsule_imagev5":"https: