/apps/2926300/extras/1705aacbab1a7777e1717f148185230c.avif?t=1768314443\" width=64 height=64 /></span>CEO: He loves approving quotes!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926300/extras/c9134372cb5915360a43933ee2c10116.avif?t=1768314443\" width=64 height=64 /></span>CFO: He loves counting the money in our bank account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926300/extras/f2600a06a2971c80ee664aa1dda1039f.avif?t=1768314443\" width=64 height=64 /></span>Greenbox: Request for quotation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926300/extras/969ad1e96a474ed11d4112fe1c4805b7.avif?t=1768314443\" width=64 height=64 /></span>Redbox: Billing request</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's really simple... but please don't send the wrong box, they will be damaged if they see documents they don't understand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and it's dangerous to touch the box directly; it's extremely violent, so you'll have to use magic to deal with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1P or 2P Story mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main mode of this work.<br>A single-player or 2P co-op mode that follows Takeru's story at L.Planning. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1P or 2P High Score mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A mode where two people work together, either single or by screen sharing, to aim for a high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4P Battle mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four employees might send documents all over the place using screen sharing, and sometimes they might make a mistake and hit someone on their team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last employee who survives is the winner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please have fun with Remote Play Together!</p>","developers":["Ikerandal Lab"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926300/42c54b00c95382ee4875f3f9acad94911dddfda0/header.jpg?t=1768314443","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Made with Pixel Game Maker MV<br />\r\n\u00a92018 Gotcha Gotcha Games<br />\r\nThe following acts regarding this software are prohibited.<br />\r\n - Acts of extracting, distributing, modifying, etc. programs or materials (regardless of paid or free)<br />\r\n - Extracting materials and using them in your own games (regardless of paid or free)","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2926300/683645/8eccf84cced690327bf82bb7a1df974e83c7cfb0/1750889538/dash_av1.mpd?t=1713298673","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2926300/683645/8eccf84cced690327bf82bb7a1df974e83c7cfb0/1750889538/dash_h264.mpd?t=1713298673","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2926300/683645/8eccf84cced690327bf82bb7a1df974e83c7cfb0/1750889538/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1713298673","id":257013555,"name":"Takeru","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257013555/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1713298673"}],"name":"Sales employee Takeru-Kun","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Sales employee Takeru-Kun - $2.99 USD","packageid":1042408,"percent_savings":0,"percent_sav